{% comment %}
  ==========================================================================
  ZeroStick EXO: "Supported games" showcase page (staged)
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template: templates/page.exo-games.json
  Preview:  https://zerostickgaming.com/pages/zerostick-exo?view=exo-games

  What is on this page, top to bottom:
    1. Hero: headline, the game counts (they count up), and what the three
       statuses (Ready / In progress / Planned) mean.
    2. Find your game: filter buttons + search box + all 29 game cards.
       The cards and the filter bar come from snippets/zs-exo2-games.liquid
       (THE one games list, generated by C:\zsg\overhaul\tools\make_games.py).
       Never copy the cards into this file: change the table in make_games.py
       and re-run it, and every page that shows games updates together.
    3. What the chips mean (a key for the little labels on each card).
    4. NBA 2K27 spotlight (Auto green) with a real app screenshot.
    5. Works in every game.
    6. Requirements (HDMI) + fair-play note + trademark line.
    7. Pre-order and "Request a game".

  Look and behaviour come from the shared design system:
    assets/zs-exo2.css  (colours, cards, badges, buttons, reveal animation)
    assets/zs-exo2.js   (reveal on scroll, the status filter, scroll progress)
  Extra styles only this page needs are in the style block below. They are
  all under .zg so they cannot affect any other page.
  The small script at the bottom of this file adds the search box, the
  count-up numbers and the "jump to filter" links.

  Copy rules (from C:\zsg\overhaul\BRIEF.md): game names as text only (no
  logos), never promise greens or rates, "Measured aim curve" only for
  Black Ops II, MW4 and Warzone, heroes/operators/agents are lists only.
  ==========================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'zs-exo2.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'zs-exo2.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{%- liquid
  # Links come from the section settings (Theme editor > this section).
  # The "| default:" part is what is used while a setting is left empty.
  assign preorder_url = section.settings.preorder_url | default: '/products/zerostick-exo'
  # The Discord invite link is not known yet. Until Caleb pastes the real
  # invite into the section setting, this placeholder anchor is used.
  assign discord_url = section.settings.discord_url | default: '#discord-invite-placeholder'
  assign manual_url = section.settings.manual_url
  assign sid = section.id
-%}

<style>
  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     Page-only styles. Everything starts with .zg (the root of this
     section), so nothing here can leak into the rest of the store.
     1rem = 10px in this theme.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .zg{
    /* How far below the top of the screen the filter bar sticks.
       The store header is not sticky today. If a sticky header is ever
       switched on, raise this to the header's height (e.g. 8rem). */
    --zg-stick:1.2rem;
  }
  .zg .x2-sec{ overflow:clip; }

  /* Why this is here: assets/zerostick-custom.css sets
     "html, body { overflow-x: hidden }" for the whole store. "hidden" turns
     the page body into its own scroll box, and that silently stops position:sticky
     from working anywhere inside it (our filter bar would never stick).
     "clip" cuts off sideways overflow exactly the same way but does not make
     a scroll box, so sticky works. This style block only loads on this page, so
     no other page changes. Browsers too old for "clip" ignore it and keep the
     old behaviour (the bar just doesn't stick). */
  @supports (overflow:clip){
    html, body{ overflow-x:clip; }
  }
  /* The theme's base.css hides every empty div element ("div:empty{display:none}").
     The glow backdrop and the faint grid lines are empty div elements on purpose,
     so switch them back on here. */
  .zg .x2-aura, .zg .x2-gridlines{ display:block; }
  /* ".x2 a" (link colour) is more specific than ".x2-btn--primary", so link
     buttons came out blue-on-blue. Put the button text colours back. */
  .zg a.x2-btn{ color:var(--x-ink); }
  .zg a.x2-btn--primary, .zg a.x2-btn--discord{ color:#fff; }

  /* ---------- 1. hero ---------- */
  .zg-hero{ padding:11rem 0 9rem; }
  .zg-hero .x2-h1{ margin-bottom:2.4rem; }

  /* the row of four counts: 2 Ready · 14 In progress · 13 Planned | 29 games */
  .zg-stats{ display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:stretch; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem;
    margin:4.4rem auto 0; max-width:96rem; }
  .zg-stat{ position:relative; flex:1 1 0; min-width:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:.4rem;
    padding:2.2rem 1.6rem 2rem; border-radius:2rem; border:1px solid var(--x-line);
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.045),rgba(255,255,255,.015));
    color:var(--x-ink); text-decoration:none;
    transition:transform .35s var(--x-ease), border-color .3s, background .3s; }
  .x2 a.zg-stat{ color:var(--x-ink); }
  .zg-stat:hover{ transform:translateY(-3px); border-color:var(--x-line2); }
  .zg-num{ font-size:clamp(4.4rem,6vw,7.2rem); font-weight:800; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.04em;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; min-width:2ch; text-align:center; }
  .zg-stat-label{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--x-soft); white-space:nowrap; }
  .zg-stat-label::before{ content:""; width:.8rem; height:.8rem; border-radius:50%; background:currentColor; box-shadow:0 0 1rem currentColor; }
  .zg-stat--ready .zg-num{ color:var(--x-green); }   .zg-stat--ready .zg-stat-label::before{ color:var(--x-green); }
  .zg-stat--progress .zg-num{ color:var(--x-amber); } .zg-stat--progress .zg-stat-label::before{ color:var(--x-amber); }
  .zg-stat--planned .zg-num{ color:#b9c6d8; }        .zg-stat--planned .zg-stat-label::before{ color:#9fb0c8; }
  .zg-stat--all{ border-color:rgba(98,184,255,.35);
    background:radial-gradient(30rem 14rem at 50% 0,rgba(98,184,255,.22),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(41,141,223,.12),rgba(41,141,223,.03)); }
  .zg-stat--all .zg-stat-label::before{ display:none; }
  /* the little "·" and "=" signs between the counts (decoration only) */
  .zg-op{ align-self:center; font-size:2.4rem; font-weight:300; color:var(--x-mute); }

  /* proportion bar under the counts: each part is as wide as its count.
     It grows in from the left (scaleX) when it scrolls into view: that is a
     transform, so it stays smooth at 60 fps. */
  .zg-bar{ display:flex; gap:.4rem; height:.8rem; max-width:96rem; margin:2rem auto 0; }
  .zg-bar i{ flex:var(--g) 1 0; border-radius:99rem; transform:scaleX(0); transform-origin:left center;
    transition:transform 1.2s var(--x-ease) var(--bd,0s); }
  .zg-bar i.r{ background:var(--x-green); box-shadow:0 0 1.6rem rgba(61,220,151,.5); }
  .zg-bar i.p{ background:var(--x-amber); box-shadow:0 0 1.6rem rgba(246,185,76,.35); }
  .zg-bar i.l{ background:#6f7f96; }
  .zg-bar.is-in i, .x2:not(.x2-js) .zg-bar i{ transform:none; }

  /* the three "what the status means" cards */
  .zg-status{ margin-top:5.6rem; text-align:left; }
  .zg-status .x2-card{ padding:2.6rem; }
  .zg-status .x2-badge{ margin:0 0 1.6rem; }
  .zg-open{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:2.8rem 0 0;
    font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--x-soft); }
  .zg-open b{ color:var(--x-ink); }
  .zg-open svg{ width:2rem; height:2rem; color:var(--x-green); flex:0 0 auto; }

  /* ---------- 2. find your game (filter + search + grid) ---------- */
  .zg-browse{ padding-top:4rem; }
  /* The filter bar sticks under the top of the screen while you scroll the
     grid. pointer-events:none on the bar itself means the empty space beside
     the buttons never blocks clicks on the cards scrolling underneath. */
  .zg .x2-gamesbar{ position:sticky; top:var(--zg-stick); z-index:20; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:1rem;
    pointer-events:none; }
  .zg .x2-gamesbar > *{ pointer-events:auto; }
  /* while stuck, a soft dark fade behind the bar keeps it readable over the
     cards (fades in with opacity only, so it stays smooth) */
  .zg .x2-gamesbar::before{ content:""; position:absolute; z-index:-1; left:50%; width:100vw; translate:-50% 0;
    top:calc(var(--zg-stick) * -1); bottom:-2.4rem; pointer-events:none; opacity:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,7,13,.92) 55%,rgba(5,7,13,0)); transition:opacity .35s var(--x-ease); }
  .zg .x2-gamesbar.is-stuck::before{ opacity:1; }
  .zg .x2-filter{ background:rgba(12,18,32,.78); border-color:var(--x-line2);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(1.4); backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(1.4);
    box-shadow:0 1rem 3rem -1.6rem rgba(0,0,0,.6); transition:box-shadow .4s var(--x-ease); }
  .zg .x2-filter button:not([aria-pressed="true"]):hover{ color:var(--x-ink); background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); }
  .zg .x2-gamesbar.is-stuck .x2-filter, .zg .x2-gamesbar.is-stuck .zg-search{ box-shadow:0 1.6rem 4rem -1rem rgba(0,0,0,.85), 0 0 0 1px rgba(98,184,255,.12); }

  /* search box (the script moves it into the sticky bar and shows it;
     without JavaScript it stays hidden, because it could not do anything) */
  .zg-search{ position:relative; display:flex; align-items:center; width:26rem; height:5.4rem; border-radius:99rem;
    border:1px solid var(--x-line2); background:rgba(12,18,32,.78);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(1.4); backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(1.4);
    box-shadow:0 1rem 3rem -1.6rem rgba(0,0,0,.6); transition:border-color .3s, box-shadow .4s var(--x-ease); }
  .zg-search[hidden]{ display:none; }
  .zg-search:focus-within{ border-color:rgba(98,184,255,.6); }
  .zg-search svg{ position:absolute; left:1.8rem; width:1.8rem; height:1.8rem; color:var(--x-mute); pointer-events:none; }
  .zg-search input{ width:100%; height:100%; padding:0 1.8rem 0 4.6rem; border:0; border-radius:inherit; background:none;
    font:inherit; font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--x-ink); -webkit-appearance:none; appearance:none; }
  .zg-search input::placeholder{ color:var(--x-mute); }
  .zg-search input:focus{ outline:none; }
  .zg-search input::-webkit-search-cancel-button{ filter:invert(1) brightness(.8); cursor:pointer; }

  /* search hides cards with this class (separate from the status filter,
     which uses the hidden attribute, so the two combine) */
  .zg .x2-game.zg-out{ display:none; }

  /* message when nothing matches */
  .zg-empty{ max-width:60rem; margin:1rem auto 0; padding:3.2rem 2.4rem; text-align:center; border-radius:2rem;
    border:1px dashed var(--x-line2); color:var(--x-soft); }
  .zg-empty[hidden]{ display:none; }
  .zg-empty p{ margin:0 0 1.2rem; }
  .zg-empty p:last-child{ margin:0; }
  .zg-empty b{ color:var(--x-ink); }
  .zg-empty button{ font:inherit; font-weight:700; color:var(--x-blue2); background:none; border:0; padding:0; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:underline; }

  /* ---------- 3. chip key ---------- */
  .zg-key .x2-card{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.4rem; }
  .zg-key .x2-feats{ margin:0; }
  .zg-key .x2-card p + p{ margin-top:-.4rem; font-size:1.35rem; color:var(--x-mute); }

  /* ---------- 4. NBA 2K27 spotlight ---------- */
  .zg-nba{ background:
      radial-gradient(70rem 40rem at 78% 50%,rgba(61,220,151,.13),transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(50rem 30rem at 10% 0%,rgba(246,185,76,.08),transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,var(--x-bg),var(--x-bg2) 50%,var(--x-bg)); }
  .zg-nba .x2-badge{ margin:0 0 1.6rem; }
  .zg-points{ display:grid; gap:1.4rem; margin:0 0 2.8rem; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .zg-points li{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:3.6rem minmax(0,1fr); gap:1.4rem; align-items:start; }
  .zg-points li > span{ display:grid; place-items:center; width:3.6rem; height:3.6rem; border-radius:1.1rem;
    color:var(--x-green); background:rgba(61,220,151,.1); border:1px solid rgba(61,220,151,.28); }
  .zg-points svg{ width:1.8rem; height:1.8rem; }
  .zg-points b{ display:block; font-size:1.65rem; color:var(--x-ink); }
  .zg-points p{ margin:.2rem 0 0; color:var(--x-soft); font-size:1.5rem; line-height:1.5; }
  /* The screenshot is the top part of the phone screen (786 x 1289 px), so
     this phone is shorter than a full one and fades out at the bottom. */
  .zg-phone-wrap{ position:relative; }
  .zg-phone-wrap::before{ content:""; position:absolute; left:50%; top:45%; width:34rem; height:34rem; translate:-50% -50%;
    border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(61,220,151,.35),transparent 65%); filter:blur(4rem); pointer-events:none; }
  .zg-phone{ width:min(36rem,80vw); aspect-ratio:5/8; will-change:transform;
    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#000 72%,transparent 99%); mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#000 72%,transparent 99%);
    /* --p goes from 0 to 1 while the phone crosses the screen (zs-exo2.js,
       data-x2-progress). This turns it into a gentle drift and tilt. */
    transform:translate3d(0,calc((var(--p,.5) - .5) * -7rem),0) rotate(calc((var(--p,.5) - .5) * -5deg)); }
  .zg-phone::before{ display:none; } /* no camera notch: it would cover the app's title bar */
  .zg-phone .x2-phone-screen{ border-bottom-left-radius:0; border-bottom-right-radius:0; }

  /* ---------- 5. works in every game ---------- */
  .zg-every .x2-card{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:4.8rem minmax(0,1fr); gap:1.6rem; align-items:start; padding:2.4rem; }
  .zg-every .x2-icon{ margin:0; }
  .zg-every .x2-h3{ font-size:1.9rem; margin:.2rem 0 .4rem; }
  .zg-every .x2-card p{ font-size:1.45rem; line-height:1.5; }

  /* ---------- 6. requirements + fair play ---------- */
  .zg-notesec{ padding-top:0; }
  .zg-notes{ display:grid; gap:1.2rem; }
  .zg-notes .x2-notice{ font-size:1.5rem; padding:1.8rem 2rem; }
  .zg-notes .x2-notice b{ display:block; margin:0 0 .3rem; }
  .zg-tm{ margin:2rem 0 0; text-align:center; }

  /* ---------- 7. pre-order + request a game ---------- */
  .zg-cta .x2-card{ padding:4rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:0; }
  .zg-cta .x2-h2{ font-size:clamp(3rem,3.6vw,4.6rem); }
  .zg-cta .x2-btns{ margin:1.2rem 0 0; align-self:stretch; }
  .zg-cta .x2-fine{ margin:2rem 0 0; }
  .zg-cta-main{ border-color:rgba(98,184,255,.35) !important;
    background:radial-gradient(50rem 30rem at 0 0,rgba(41,141,223,.28),transparent 65%),linear-gradient(180deg,var(--x-card2),var(--x-card)) !important; }
  .zg-price{ margin:0 0 .6rem; font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--x-soft); }
  .zg-price b{ color:var(--x-ink); }

  /* ---------- phones (375 px and up) ---------- */
  @media (max-width:989px){
    .zg-nba .x2-split{ gap:5rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width:749px){
    .zg-hero{ padding:7rem 0 6rem; }
    /* counts: three small tiles in a row, the total on its own row */
    .zg-stats{ gap:.8rem; }
    .zg-op{ display:none; }
    .zg-stat{ padding:1.6rem .8rem 1.4rem; border-radius:1.6rem; }
    .zg-stat--all{ flex-basis:100%; flex-direction:row; justify-content:center; gap:1.2rem; padding:1.4rem; }
    .zg-stat-label{ font-size:1.25rem; }
    .zg-stat-label::before{ width:.6rem; height:.6rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width:599px){
    .zg-num{ font-size:4rem; }
    .zg-status{ margin-top:4rem; }
    /* filter: one row of four equal-ish buttons, count under each label */
    .zg .x2-gamesbar{ flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:.8rem; margin-bottom:2.4rem; }
    .zg .x2-filter{ display:flex; flex-wrap:nowrap; gap:.4rem; padding:.5rem; border-radius:1.8rem; }
    .zg .x2-filter button{ flex:1 1 auto; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:.1rem;
      padding:.7rem .4rem; font-size:1.3rem; line-height:1.25; white-space:nowrap; border-radius:1.3rem; }
    .zg .x2-filter button span{ margin:0; font-size:1.15rem; }
    .zg-search{ width:100%; height:4.6rem; }
    .zg-cta .x2-card{ padding:2.8rem 2.2rem; }
    .zg-cta .x2-btn{ width:100%; }
    .zg-every .x2-card{ grid-template-columns:4rem minmax(0,1fr); gap:1.4rem; padding:2rem; }
    .zg-every .x2-icon{ width:4rem; height:4rem; border-radius:1.2rem; }
    .zg-every .x2-icon svg{ width:2rem; height:2rem; }
  }
</style>

<div class="x2 zg" id="zg-{{ sid }}">

  {%- comment -%} ================= 1. HERO ================= {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="x2-sec zg-hero x2-center" aria-labelledby="zg-title-{{ sid }}">
    <div class="x2-aura" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="x2-gridlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="x2-wrap">
      <p class="x2-eyebrow" data-reveal>ZeroStick EXO</p>
      <h1 class="x2-h1" id="zg-title-{{ sid }}" data-reveal style="--d:.06s">Supported <span class="x2-grad">games</span></h1>
      <p class="x2-lede" data-reveal style="--d:.12s">
        29 games are in the ZeroStick app today, each with a ready-made config to start from.
        Every one of them can be picked. Nothing is locked.
      </p>

      {%- comment -%}
        The counts. Each tile is a link: with JavaScript it also switches the
        filter below to that status. data-zg-count is the number the tile
        counts up to (the number written inside is shown if JS is off).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="zg-stats" data-zg-stats data-reveal style="--d:.18s">
        <a class="zg-stat zg-stat--ready" href="#zg-browse-{{ sid }}" data-zg-jump="ready">
          <span class="zg-num" data-zg-count="2">2</span><span class="zg-stat-label">Ready</span>
        </a>
        <span class="zg-op" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
        <a class="zg-stat zg-stat--progress" href="#zg-browse-{{ sid }}" data-zg-jump="progress">
          <span class="zg-num" data-zg-count="14">14</span><span class="zg-stat-label">In progress</span>
        </a>
        <span class="zg-op" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
        <a class="zg-stat zg-stat--planned" href="#zg-browse-{{ sid }}" data-zg-jump="planned">
          <span class="zg-num" data-zg-count="13">13</span><span class="zg-stat-label">Planned</span>
        </a>
        <span class="zg-op" aria-hidden="true">=</span>
        <a class="zg-stat zg-stat--all" href="#zg-browse-{{ sid }}" data-zg-jump="all">
          <span class="zg-num" data-zg-count="29">29</span><span class="zg-stat-label">games in all</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="zg-bar" aria-hidden="true" data-reveal style="--d:.3s">
        <i class="r" style="--g:2;--bd:.35s"></i><i class="p" style="--g:14;--bd:.5s"></i><i class="l" style="--g:13;--bd:.65s"></i>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} What each status means (exactly as the app means it) {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="x2-grid x2-grid--3 zg-status">
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal style="--d:0s">
          <span class="x2-badge x2-badge--ready">Ready</span>
          <h2 class="x2-h3">Fully done</h2>
          <p>Aim, Scripts and automatic gun detection are all finished and tuned for the game.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal style="--d:.08s">
          <span class="x2-badge x2-badge--progress">In progress</span>
          <h2 class="x2-h3">Play it today</h2>
          <p>Selectable and usable right now. Work made just for this game is still underway, and each card shows what is already there.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal style="--d:.16s">
          <span class="x2-badge x2-badge--planned">Planned</span>
          <h2 class="x2-h3">Start from a starter config</h2>
          <p>Selectable with a starter config you can tune. Mappings, Scripts and everything in "Works in every game" are there from day one.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="zg-open" data-reveal>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 7.5-2"/></svg>
        <span><b>Every game can be picked in the app.</b> Playing something that isn't listed? Choose "My game isn't here" and start from scratch.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ================= 2. FIND YOUR GAME ================= {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="x2-sec x2-sec--tight zg-browse" id="zg-browse-{{ sid }}" aria-labelledby="zg-browse-title-{{ sid }}">
    <div class="x2-wrap">
      <div class="x2-center">
        <p class="x2-eyebrow" data-reveal>All 29 games</p>
        <h2 class="x2-h2" id="zg-browse-title-{{ sid }}" data-reveal style="--d:.06s">Find your game.</h2>
        <p class="x2-lede" data-reveal style="--d:.12s">Filter by status or search by name. Each card shows what the EXO does in that game today. <a href="#zg-key-{{ sid }}">What the chips mean</a></p>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        The search box starts hidden; the script below moves it into the
        sticky filter bar and shows it.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="zg-search" data-zg-search hidden>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
        <label class="x2-sr" for="zg-q-{{ sid }}">Search games by name</label>
        <input id="zg-q-{{ sid }}" type="search" placeholder="Search games" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" enterkeyhint="search">
      </div>

      <div data-zg-browse>
        {%- comment -%} THE one games list: filter bar + all 29 cards {%- endcomment -%}
        {% render 'zs-exo2-games', mode: 'full' %}

        <div class="zg-empty" data-zg-empty hidden>
          <p>No game matches <b data-zg-q></b><span data-zg-where></span>.</p>
          <p data-zg-elsewhere hidden>It's in another list: <button type="button" data-zg-showall>show all games</button></p>
